              "content": "Monochrome, inspired by x.ai: ink on warm paper, pill actions, flat cards. Color is reserved for meaning — canvas selection (blue), the AI agent (teal), and status. Tokens are layered primitive → semantic → component and resolve per mode (light / dark).",
